[{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32500200_04_0000","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32500200_04_0009","text":"广播声音"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32500200_04_0010","text":"『────时间已过下午4点30分\n　接下来是Rising Artist的环节』"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32500200_04_0019","text":"广播声音"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32500200_04_0020","text":"『本周要介绍的是这张单曲，当当！\n　备受瞩目的实力派组合，SHHis的────』"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32500200_04_0021","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32500200_04_0029","text":"出租车司机"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32500200_04_0030","text":"……我说，客人？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32500200_04_0040","text":"啊，好的……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32500200_04_0049","text":"出租车司机"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32500200_04_0050","text":"嗯——可能是我想多了\n各位客人────"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32500200_04_0051","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32500200_04_0059","text":"出租车司机"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32500200_04_0060","text":"────该不会是想走普通道路吧？\n看你们一直在东张西望的……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32500200_04_0070","text":"啊，那个，没有没有，这条路完全没问题……！\n谢谢您……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32500200_04_0071","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32500200_04_0080","text":"……是啊\n要稳稳地沿着这条路开下去────"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32500200_04_0090","text":"────让更多的人看到、听到才行"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32500200_04_0100","text":"是的……\n没错……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32500200_04_0101","text":"Motion"}]
